	text: [
		"The Fusion Reactor Vessel is an expensive machine that can produce: ",
		"- Helium-4 ",
		"- Ionized Particles ",
		"- Chlorophyte powder ",
		"- Thermonuclear Ashes ",
		"- Gold Powder",
		"",
		"Ionized Particles makes Schrabidium armor, other particles, and Chlorophyte powder for tools.",
		"",
		"As reward, rare materials are refunded 1/3, and common materials 1/2",
		"",
		"§2Fusion Reactor§r",
		"",
		"The Fusion Reactor (Torus) is modular and can be extended with over 5 optional components, the Vessel being the main operating body.",
		"",
		"To operate, the main body requires a Klystron, electricity, and cold perfluoromethyl.",
		"",
		"It has 4 connection ports for components, these are found on the sides of the machine (they are pretty big).",
		"",
		"Components that use plasma energy (and not just neutron flux) split the total output, a single component will receive 100% of the energy, two will receive 62.5%, three 50% each.",
		"Flux output stays steady and shares equally with all devices.",
		"",
		"External energy and fuel levels determine working speed, if any is below 50%, the reactor will decrease productivity. ",
		"",
		"More KyUs (Klystron energy unit) do not accelerate production."
